<view class="page feature-page my-projects-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="我的项目"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="feature-tabs"><button class="feature-tab {{tab === item ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" data-tab="{{item}}" bindtap="changeTab">{{item}}</button></view><button class="owned-project panel" wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="viewProduct"><view class="owned-project-image"><media-placeholder src="{{item.image}}" label="项目图片" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder></view><view class="owned-project-copy"><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.status}}</view><view class="owned-project-quota">剩余 {{item.remaining}} / {{item.total}} 次</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" size="25"></ui-icon></button><view wx:if="{{!visible.length}}" class="owned-project-empty panel"><view class="personal-empty-icon"><ui-icon name="grid" size="64"></ui-icon></view><view class="empty-title">暂无{{tab}}的项目</view><view class="card-note">已购项目与服务进度将在这里展示</view><button class="primary-button personal-empty-action" bindtap="browse">查看全部项目</button></view><button wx:if="{{pendingCount}}" class="panel personal-link" bindtap="pending"><view><view>待付款订单（{{pendingCount}}）</view><view class="card-note">演示待付款订单不计入已购项目</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" size="27"></ui-icon></button><view class="notice">项目权益与使用记录需由机构同步，当前演示订单不会产生真实服务权益。</view></view></view>
